{"id":"8acc7c3954935c64","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-dirichlet-density.md","title":"Dirichlet Density","display":"df-dirichlet-density — Dirichlet Density","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-dirichlet-density","aliases":["58-df-dirichlet-density"],"display":"df-dirichlet-density — Dirichlet Density","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-dirichlet-density"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-dirichlet-density</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dirichlet-density — Dirichlet Density"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e62b6beb4c1e82d\" href=\"?note=4e62b6beb4c1e82d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md\">../batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,j,\\iota,S,\\mathcal P,L\\in V\">\\(K,\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,j,\\iota,S,\\mathcal P,L\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span>（域谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>（函数谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\">\\(\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\)</span>（七元整数环谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e62b6beb4c1e82d\" href=\"?note=4e62b6beb4c1e82d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md\">../batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumberFieldPresentation}_S,\\mathrm{RingPrimeIdeal}_S,\\mathrm{NonzeroPrimeSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{NumberFieldPresentation}_S,\\mathrm{RingPrimeIdeal}_S,\\mathrm{NonzeroPrimeSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>（此处定义的辅助谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirichletDensity}_S,\\mathrm{NaturalPrimeDensity}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{DirichletDensity}_S,\\mathrm{NaturalPrimeDensity}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（此处定义的密度关系）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}number\\text{-}field\\text{-}presentation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{NumberFieldPresentation}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,j)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,\\mathbb Q,K)\n\\land j(0)=0_K\\land j(1)=1_K\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n\\bigl(j(a+b)=j(a)+_Kj(b)\\land j(ab)=j(a)\\cdot_Kj(b)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(j(a)=j(b)\\to a=b)\n\\land\\operatorname{dim}_{j[\\mathbb Q]}K\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}number\\text{-}field\\text{-}presentation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{NumberFieldPresentation}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,j)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,\\mathbb Q,K)\n\\land j(0)=0_K\\land j(1)=1_K\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n\\bigl(j(a+b)=j(a)+_Kj(b)\\land j(ab)=j(a)\\cdot_Kj(b)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(j(a)=j(b)\\to a=b)\n\\land\\operatorname{dim}_{j[\\mathbb Q]}K\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ring\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RingPrimeIdeal}_S(\\mathfrak p;\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathfrak p\\subsetneq\\mathcal O\\land0_K\\in\\mathfrak p\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathfrak p\\;(a+_Kb\\in\\mathfrak p)\n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathfrak p\\;\\exists b\\in\\mathfrak p\\;(a+_Kb=0_K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall r\\in\\mathcal O\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathfrak p\\;(r\\cdot_Ka\\in\\mathfrak p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathcal O\\;\n\\bigl(a\\cdot_Kb\\in\\mathfrak p\\to a\\in\\mathfrak p\\lor b\\in\\mathfrak p\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ring\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RingPrimeIdeal}_S(\\mathfrak p;\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathfrak p\\subsetneq\\mathcal O\\land0_K\\in\\mathfrak p\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathfrak p\\;(a+_Kb\\in\\mathfrak p)\n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathfrak p\\;\\exists b\\in\\mathfrak p\\;(a+_Kb=0_K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall r\\in\\mathcal O\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathfrak p\\;(r\\cdot_Ka\\in\\mathfrak p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathcal O\\;\n\\bigl(a\\cdot_Kb\\in\\mathfrak p\\to a\\in\\mathfrak p\\lor b\\in\\mathfrak p\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nonzero\\text{-}prime\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NonzeroPrimeSpectrum}_S(\\mathcal P;\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal P=\n\\{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal O):\n\\mathrm{RingPrimeIdeal}_S(\\mathfrak p;\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land\\mathfrak p\\neq\\{0_K\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nonzero\\text{-}prime\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NonzeroPrimeSpectrum}_S(\\mathcal P;\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal P=\n\\{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal O):\n\\mathrm{RingPrimeIdeal}_S(\\mathfrak p;\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land\\mathfrak p\\neq\\{0_K\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}density}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirichletDensity}_S(S,K,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,j,\\iota,\\mathcal P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{NumberFieldPresentation}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,j)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\iota=j\\upharpoonright\\mathbb Z\n\\land\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{NonzeroPrimeSpectrum}_S(\\mathcal P;\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land S\\subseteq\\mathcal P\\land L\\in[0,1]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\eta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(1&lt;s&lt;1+\\eta\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\quad 0&lt;\\sum_{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathcal P}|\\mathcal O/\\mathfrak p|^{-s}\n\\land\\left|\n\\frac{\\sum_{\\mathfrak p\\in S}|\\mathcal O/\\mathfrak p|^{-s}}\n{\\sum_{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathcal P}|\\mathcal O/\\mathfrak p|^{-s}}-L\n\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}density}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirichletDensity}_S(S,K,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,j,\\iota,\\mathcal P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{NumberFieldPresentation}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,j)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\iota=j\\upharpoonright\\mathbb Z\n\\land\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{NonzeroPrimeSpectrum}_S(\\mathcal P;\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land S\\subseteq\\mathcal P\\land L\\in[0,1]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\eta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(1&lt;s&lt;1+\\eta\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\quad 0&lt;\\sum_{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathcal P}|\\mathcal O/\\mathfrak p|^{-s}\n\\land\\left|\n\\frac{\\sum_{\\mathfrak p\\in S}|\\mathcal O/\\mathfrak p|^{-s}}\n{\\sum_{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathcal P}|\\mathcal O/\\mathfrak p|^{-s}}-L\n\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}natural\\text{-}prime\\text{-}density}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NaturalPrimeDensity}_S(S,K,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,j,\\iota,\\mathcal P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{NumberFieldPresentation}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,j)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\iota=j\\upharpoonright\\mathbb Z\n\\land\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{NonzeroPrimeSpectrum}_S(\\mathcal P;\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land S\\subseteq\\mathcal P\\land L\\in[0,1]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists x_0\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(x&gt;x_0\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\quad 0&lt;|\\{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathcal P:|\\mathcal O/\\mathfrak p|\\leq x\\}|\n\\land\\left|\n\\frac{|\\{\\mathfrak p\\in S:|\\mathcal O/\\mathfrak p|\\leq x\\}|}\n{|\\{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathcal P:|\\mathcal O/\\mathfrak p|\\leq x\\}|}-L\n\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}natural\\text{-}prime\\text{-}density}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NaturalPrimeDensity}_S(S,K,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,j,\\iota,\\mathcal P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{NumberFieldPresentation}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,j)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\iota=j\\upharpoonright\\mathbb Z\n\\land\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{NonzeroPrimeSpectrum}_S(\\mathcal P;\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land S\\subseteq\\mathcal P\\land L\\in[0,1]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists x_0\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(x&gt;x_0\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\quad 0&lt;|\\{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathcal P:|\\mathcal O/\\mathfrak p|\\leq x\\}|\n\\land\\left|\n\\frac{|\\{\\mathfrak p\\in S:|\\mathcal O/\\mathfrak p|\\leq x\\}|}\n{|\\{\\mathfrak p\\in\\mathcal P:|\\mathcal O/\\mathfrak p|\\leq x\\}|}-L\n\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>三元密度关系通过存在量词投影一个完整的数域表示，因而保留既有下游签名，同时不再以错误的二元方式调用七元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>商环基数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal O/\\mathfrak p|\">\\(|\\mathcal O/\\mathfrak p|\\)</span> 只在已给定环运算和素理想守卫后出现；两个比值也都显式要求分母为正。</li>\n<li>若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NaturalPrimeDensity}_S(S,K,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{NaturalPrimeDensity}_S(S,K,L)\\)</span>，则同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirichletDensity}_S(S,K,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{DirichletDensity}_S(S,K,L)\\)</span>；这是一个 Abelian 型定理，而不是密度定义的一部分。</li>\n<li>Dirichlet 密度本身也不保证对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 存在；上、下 Dirichlet 密度可用上、下极限定义。</li>\n<li>Chebotarev 密度定理给出指定 Frobenius 共轭类的素理想集合之密度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|C|/|G|\">\\(|C|/|G|\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>旧依赖 <code>df-prime-ideal</code> 定义的是幂集布尔代数上的集合素理想；这里改用整数环并显式给出交换环素理想守卫，避免同名概念误配。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md","status":"resolved","id":"4e62b6beb4c1e82d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S$（域谓词，见 [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]）与 $\\mathrm{Function}$（函数谓词）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md","status":"resolved","id":"4e62b6beb4c1e82d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)$（七元整数环谓词，见 [[../batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,j,\\iota,S